md files/
# The brand kit: a 234 KB zip, a 78 KB design canvas and the PNGs the
# project shipped BEFORE the mark. Reference only: tools/build-brand.py carries its
# values by hand and reads nothing from it, so neither the image nor a clone needs it.
Branding/
# brand/ is a game resource folder, so anything dropped in it is packed into
# the game download AND published under /brand/. Only the mark's own files go
# in; a social header or any other design export stays out of the image.
brand/*
!brand/agaripo-*
verification/
# No markdown goes into the image.
*.md
# Hidden files and folders at the root: git, tool caches, local env files.
.*
build/
archives/
server/node_modules/
node_modules/
